🌟 StarPulse
Astronaut Health Monitoring & Early Warning System

NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 | Create Health Monitoring Software for Astronauts on Space Missions

Monitoring astronaut health, one pulse at a time.

🚀 Overview

StarPulse is an astronaut-centered health monitoring platform that collects, visualizes, and analyzes physiological and wellness data during space missions.

The system gives astronauts a centralized dashboard to monitor daily health and spot potential complications before they escalate.

